- **Telemetry:** `view.opened` emitted once with slug `OfflineBanner` (P1/S11).
- **A11y:** VoiceOver labels on every element, combined title+message, polite announcement on going offline (role=status/aria-live parity), Reduce-Motion via `TSAnimation`, Dynamic Type via tokens.
- No prohibited words; uses `InMemory*` sources (not "mock").

